description.text:
One single piercing attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants Instant ATB 1 & Instant Cast 1 to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Holy Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if there are at least 0/4 Knight/XIV members;
WS Blue: Grants [Dualcast Holy 3, Instant Holy 3 & Weakness Damage +30% for 3 turns] to user
WS Gold: Grants [Surging Power +30%] to party

